# ---- Personal data: never commit ----
# This repo is public. Financial data must never leave the machine, so these
# match anywhere in the tree rather than only at the root: a leading-slash
# pattern like "data/tasks.db" anchors to this directory and would not have
# covered friday-cli/data/ at all.
**/data/
**/logs/
*.db
*.db-*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
